 "toplevel": "Declares five Notification.Name statics (lines 12-29) and the two message enums; stored-property initialisers create the serial wcQueue (282-285), the didActivate lock (364), and static locks timeoutCounter (591), lastContextErrorMessage (730), liveStateCache, heldUntilActivation and cachedWatchDisplayOnlyMode initial true. `static let shared` (53) lazily runs init on first access. WatchControlRefusal is a String-raw enum whose raw values travel as `errorCode`.",
